  "notes": [
    "Kettle FM is not a real station; every name is from the seeds (ADR-0071).",
    "Voices are designed (OmniVoice voice design: gender, age, pitch, accent), never cloned from a person: design.mojo makes one reference per character from its description and seed, and synth.sh reads every line in that designed voice through VoiceLab's tts-serve with the same seed.",
    "Steps run in order. A line waits for itself to end unless `async`; `gap` is the pause after a step in seconds. run.mjs writes the time every step really happened to target/demo-video/run/timeline.json, and the edit reads that, not these nominal gaps."
  ],
